Verbatim copies (byte-identical to upstream; re-synced with
`node scripts/check-upstream.mjs --upstream <clone> --sync`)
-----------------------------------------------------------
Each was copied from upstream commit 14fa24dc59228c94461a9d331b0727bc5af97349
(2026-10-30):

- scripts/hook.mjs                   <- examples/agent-hook-plugin/scripts/hook.mjs
- scripts/request-budget.mjs         <- examples/agent-hook-plugin/scripts/request-budget.mjs
- servers/mcp-proxy.mjs              <- examples/agent-hook-plugin/servers/mcp-proxy.mjs
